Rust dependencies and standard library
--------------------------------------
Cargo.lock identifies Rust dependencies; each has its own applicable license.
The packaging recipe collects dependency license texts, notices, manifests and
inventory, and Rust standard-library notices, into licenses/. Some objc2 crates
require the pinned upstream workspace license statement. Source snapshots do
not contain bundled native binaries. Review the actual distributed payload,
including all source and license materials, before redistributing.
